WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.332
Some changes grow from within

2
00:00:02.332 --> 00:00:03.377
a society.

3
00:00:03.377 --> 00:00:05.537
Others come from outside.

4
00:00:05.878 --> 00:00:09.224
Sanskritisation is an indigenous process.

5
00:00:09.224 --> 00:00:12.222
Westernisation and modernisation came from

6
00:00:12.222 --> 00:00:13.337
outside.

7
00:00:13.682 --> 00:00:18.221
Srinivas defined westernisation in 1966

8
00:00:18.221 --> 00:00:20.423
as changes from British rule:

9
00:00:20.423 --> 00:00:21.556
in technology,

10
00:00:21.556 --> 00:00:24.545
institutions, ideology and values.

11
00:00:24.884 --> 00:00:27.432
Westernisation names where change came

12
00:00:27.432 --> 00:00:29.858
from. Modernisation names where it

13
00:00:29.858 --> 00:00:31.097
is heading.

14
00:00:31.785 --> 00:00:33.011
Your turn.

15
00:00:33.011 --> 00:00:34.898
What kind of change?
